# Ramos, Dragon Engine: "Whenever you cast a spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Ramos for each of that spell's colors", and
# Flying. Bot1 casts it turn 1 ({6}: Black Lotus and three Moxen). A colorless spell (Mox Ruby) adds nothing (4/4); Lightning
# Bolt (one color) adds one (5/5). On turn 3 Terminate ({B}{R}) kills Bot2's Grizzly Bears and adds two (7/7). Attacking,
# Bot2's Memnite may not block a flyer, so Ramos hits for 7: Bot2 is at 20 - 3 (the Bolt) - 7 = 10.

